  "description": {
    "raw": "The target shares in humanity’s great potential as encouraged by Aroden. The target chooses one ability score and gains a +2 enhancement bonus to that ability score. The bonus confers the usual benefit to skills and abilities based on the ability enhanced, but does not affect bonus spells or skill ranks.",
    "search_text": "\"the target shares in humanity’s great potential as encouraged by aroden. the target chooses one ability score and gains a +2 enhancement bonus to that ability score. the bonus confers the usual benefit to skills and abilities based on the ability enhanced, but does not affect bonus spells or skill ranks.\"",
